{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Milestone: partially validated MCP redeploy behavior during the maintenance window, but AC4 is NOT fully satisfied. Evidence: after rotating /rebar/prod/mcp-hmac-signing-key and re-materializing secrets, the running MCP container rebar-mcp-7ee1f35af516-8092 had MCP_HMAC_SIGNING_KEY length 64 and matched the current SSM value; public /mcp returned 401 as expected. However the autodeploy delta observed was not a secrets-only SECRETS_PATHS commit, so I am leaving this ticket open rather than claiming AC4 complete."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788771014973597001,"uuid":"b7839e5c-b760-4319-b829-d2a1ffa627ba"}